{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1218103,\"title\":\"Mother and Daughter Robot\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A film about the relationship between a mother-daughter robot.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iVZELfFCPUwcehmF3sNYBfHS05V.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2005,\"runtime\":33,\"genres\":[\"Science Fiction\",\"Action\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Tamotsu Nagata\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":4430847,\"name\":\"Tamotsu Nagata\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4430859,\"name\":\"Naomi Higashi\",\"character\":\"Mami Sekino\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4430861,\"name\":\"Yuki Nagayoshi\",\"character\":\"Mia Sekino\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4430862,\"name\":\"Masaaki Kino\",\"character\":\"Dr. Sekino\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4430866,\"name\":\"Kenryu Hari\",\"character\":\"Dr. Shutorenji\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1173788,\"name\":\"Maro Yumeno\",\"character\":\"Platea\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":212262,\"title\":\"Kamen Rider W Returns: Kamen Rider Eternal\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vzjKhUUeaTRX4quxtQWkI2RVb7r.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nUar6o9nb9KCqSp3Nzt4rkNLGfe.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Set primarily before the events of Kamen Rider W Forever, Kamen Rider Eternal tells the story of Daido Katsumi, the formation of NEVER, the mission that led them to target Fuuto, and reveals just how Daido obtained his Lost Driver and got his first taste of the power of Kamen Rider Eternal. As a mysterious woman retells this story to Phillip and Shotaro, they realize that Daido may not have been the simple monster he first appeared to be…\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":272741,\"title\":\"Tokumei Sentai Go-Busters vs. Beet Buster vs. J\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9cdwZhIKHDcKuy3aInuEE63tnnD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lpems0xHLbxOlYnudiRU8CW5Hca.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Beet J Stag goes berserk after drinking a Vaglass produced Enetron can. No one could stop J, who thinks of himself as a king. What's worse, Enter manages to transform into Beet Buster! What will Masato and the Go-Busters do to stop them? Furthermore, Space Sheriff Gavan also makes a short appearance here.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":848629,\"title\":\"Mashin Sentai Kiramager Spin-Off: Yodonna\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rZUt5ayh7pComsdnhtsKuFZoa1o.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mHHfQ0b8hJO84nG3KKTWfCNvbe.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Kiramager special focusing on the characters of Yodonna and Mizuki Kakihara\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":270691,\"title\":\"Armor Hero Emperor\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/efqGRk05JxUrAD7S7Qmsm30xmhr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kdV8zv6hJw50SWfH8RESZa0Syo4.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the Armor Heroes united to seal up the Dark Forces Monsters, the city regained its peace and happiness. Since Monster Ten was not successfully sealed up, Mei Zhen found Zi Yang, hoping that when danger and difficulty arises, Zi Yang would be able to seal up this last monster and would completely eradicate the forces of darkness on earth. Meanwhile the Five sealed in the Monster Sealing Box, in order to fulfill their quest for world domination, used the forces of darkness to entice an angry youth, and created new mutants to create havoc in the city.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":861666,\"title\":\"Zero-One Others: Kamen Rider Vulcan & Valkyrie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6ik9HERXPgo3MdZxCkqMUhcfOvK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6oDSjDxcKcEQUJsgSCXnASD02RS.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Shigeru Daimonji, the Secretary of National Defense, has ordered Yua Yaiba/Kamen Rider Valkyrie to eliminate Kamen Rider MetsubouJinrai. While she hesitates to act on this directive, the Rider itself sets sights on Valkyrie. Meanwhile, the now former Solds attempt to discover freedom for the first time without ZAIA Enterprise, while engaging in an all out war against A.I.M.S. Isamu Fuwa/Kamen Rider Vulcan, who personally witnessed the birth of Kamen Rider MetsubouJinrai, investigates to discover their true goal. What is Yua's fate, who acts on her own justice as she refuses to fight both Kamen Rider MetsubouJinrai, the Solds, & Isamu who is determined to carry out his final mission as Kamen Rider Vulcan?\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1049760,\"title\":\"Replicant Eve\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k6hUegwE8IBI5rY8UKKkTgrxCkh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oNnOdqbgOtLg95VGSAuBW7GDngI.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"One night, a mysterious object falls from the sky in a flash of light. College student Ryo Kazama (Masahiro Inoue) rushes to the scene and finds a woman lying there who looks exactly like his classmate, Saya Saeki (Haruki Iwata), whom he has a crush on. However, the woman is not Saya, she's actually a military combat android bio-replicant named Eve, who has been released into the city due to a malfunction in a mysterious facility.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":464727,\"title\":\"Dark\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7rTFMkVHc9RKq5H8KPtR3bN52YX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iuGsvQZD1EXRcWhNSIBtBWHZm0h.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"zyLI71Z0RF4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"9bwLzGzkSFI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"oWQPsxD4z2U\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}